### Try the API from VS Code: install "REST Client", then click "Send Request" above each block.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api

### 1. Log in (copy "access" into @token below)
POST {{base}}/auth/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin12345" }

###
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### 2. Dashboard
GET {{base}}/dashboard/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Stores with stock value, low and out-of-stock counts
GET {{base}}/locations/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Stock at one store (add &low=1 for low stock only)
GET {{base}}/stock/?location=1&search=paint
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Receive a supplier delivery (posts into stock immediately)
POST {{base}}/receipts/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "location": 1, "supplier": 1, "supplied_on": "2026-10-25", "invoice_number": "INV-889", "amount_paid": "20000",
  "lines": [ { "variant": 1, "quantity": "40", "unit_cost": "730" } ] }

### 6. Transfer godown → shop (admin: approved at once)
POST {{base}}/transfers/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": 1, "destination": 3, "lines": [ { "variant": 1, "quantity": "10" } ] }

### 7. Dispatch it (stock leaves the godown), then receive at the shop
POST {{base}}/transfers/1/dispatch/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/transfers/1/receive/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantities": { "1": "10" } }

### 8. Try an SMS/WhatsApp command without sending a real message
POST {{base}}/messaging/simulate/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "REMOVE GDN: PNT 4L WHITE 2 #damaged" }

### 9. Requests waiting for you
GET {{base}}/requests/?status=confirmed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Item history (stock card)
GET {{base}}/movements/?location=1&variant=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
